    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Occultus: Daughter of Darkness</strong> is an adult visual novel, detective story, and dating sim with multiple paths and romance options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY:</strong> When a Hollywood starlet asks you to find a missing woman, what choice does a private detective have other than to take the case?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our detective, Jane Malady, knew it wouldn't end well but she couldn't turn the money down. What she didn't count on was being dragged across the country from New York to Los Angeles and pulled into its seedy underbelly, rife with cults, sex and something unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Malady doesn't go alone; she'll be joined by her best friend Ash, who has her own reasons for escaping New York. And while in LA, Malady will have the chance to make new friends and lovers. But can she trust anyone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
